      "widgets_values": [
        "# MOSS SFT Create\nNative ComfyUI MOSS support required. Use a Qwen3.5 9B encoder and Flux2 VAE. Layout dimensions come from Prompt Slot. Edit layout/maps in Studio Additional Inputs.\nSFT: 50 steps, CFG 3, shift 5. Destripe is optional: 0 off; author starting values 1 at 768 and 1.5 at 1024.\nNo control adapter in this graph.\nUser LoRAs belong in the separate model-family folder; required recipe adapters are in MOSS-Required."
